{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MzEx89GSjsu28yHQKmMwsp","type":"tool_result","content":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/paper_framing.md-70-[Omitted long context line]\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/paper_framing.md-71-[Omitted long context line]\npaper_framing.md:72:- **✅ All core evidence complete.** P1 remaining: plan_012 CLIP-ViT control, plan_010 LIBERO-Spatial (P2).\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/paper_framing.md-73-\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/paper_framing.md-74-## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n--\npaper_framing.md-124-| CLIP-ViT RSA=0.557: VL pretraining >> vision-only (DINO 0.388), confirms generalizability | C1, C2 | ✅ Done — plan_012, action probe R² pending |\npaper_framing.md-125-| CKA verification: ordering reversal — CKA untrained > trained > proj > DINO | C1, C2, C7 | ✅ Done — RSA-CKA dissociation (plan_009) |\npaper_framing.md:126:| LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark | C1, C2, C3 | 📋 P2 planned (plan_010) |\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/paper_framing.md-127-\npaper_framing.md-128-### C7: RSA vs CKA metric dependency — 排序反转（plan_009 已完成）\n--\nexperiment_plan.yaml-118-    note: \"CPU-only. RSA-CKA dissociation = new finding. Claim 2 must scope as 'geometric degradation'.\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/experiment_plan.yaml-119-\nexperiment_plan.yaml:120:  - id: plan_010\nexperiment_plan.yaml-121-    claim: [1, 2, 3]\nexperiment_plan.yaml:122:    description: \"LIBERO-Spatial benchmark 扩展 — 第三个 benchmark 交叉验证\"\nexperiment_plan.yaml-123-    priority: P2\nexperiment_plan.yaml-124-    gpu_budget_hours: 4\n--\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/literature_map_probing.md-195-  - 对比 vision encoder only vs. full VLA 的 probe accuracy\nartifacts/literat